# docs/ is version-controlled: CLAUDE.md and flow.md link into it, and a clone
# without it cannot follow them. The task brief is the one thing kept out.
/docs

# generated GraphQL SDL (code-first). The checked-in copy is
# test/schema.snapshot.graphql; this is what a failing snapshot writes beside it.
/src/schema.gql
/test/schema.snapshot.graphql.actual

